  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A huay’s bonus language options include Sylvan, the language of woodland creatures, and Aklo, the tongue spoken by certain sinister fey or otherworldly denizens of reaches of the wild rarely explored by humanity. These choices are in addition to the bonus languages available to the character because of their race.</p>\n<p>A huay speaks Druidic, a secret language known only to druids, shifters, and other protectors of nature, which they learn upon becoming a 1st-level huay. Druidic is a free language for a huay; that is, they know it in addition to their regular allotment of languages, and it doesn’t take up a language slot. Huayob are forbidden to teach this language to characters who are not druids, huayob, or shifters.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
